+// against M5 (leaf: outputs/2026-09-23-sparse-mla-m6).
+//  1. The fp8 tile publish converts pairs (cvt e4m3x2 -> f16x2 is exact, then the
+//     same fp32 multiply and round-to-nearest bf16) and stores 16 B at a time,
+//     instead of one 2-byte shared store per element.
